    {
      "id": "mk_rad_e_002",
      "question": "Rationalize: 2 / (√3 + √2)",
      "choices": {
        "A": "2(√3 - √2)",
        "B": "(√3 - √2)",
        "C": "2(√3 + √2)",
        "D": "(√3 + √2) / 5",
        "E": "1 / (√3 - √2)"
      },
      "answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Multiply by conjugate: (2 / (√3 + √2)) × ((√3 - √2) / (√3 - √2)) = 2(√3 - √2) / ((√3)² - (√2)²) = 2(√3 - √2) / (3 - 2) = 2(√3 - √2).",
      "steps": [
        "1. Multiply by conjugate: (√3 - √2) / (√3 - √2).",
        "2. Numerator: 2(√3 - √2).",
        "3. Denominator: (√3)² - (√2)² = 3 - 2 = 1.",
        "4. Result: 2(√3 - √2)."
      ],
      "fastStrategy": "Conjugate for sum/difference in denominator: (a + b)(a - b) = a² - b²."
    }
